@startuml D09_stm_session
!include _style.iuml
title D09 State machine: SessionController (sw/app/session.hpp)
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Loaded : load(dir) [feed ok]
Idle --> Error : load(dir) [error]
Loaded --> Configured : configure / cfg set
Loaded --> Running : run(engine)
Configured --> Running : run(engine)
Running --> Draining : engine finished\n('Z' received)
Running --> Error : timeout / DMA error
Draining --> Done : results notified\n(ResultWriter, CLI)
Done --> Running : run(engine)
Done --> Configured : cfg set
Done --> Loaded : load(other dir)
Error --> Idle : reset [no dataset]
Error --> Loaded : reset [dataset valid]
Done --> Loaded : reset
@enduml
